# Promise of Loyalty ({4}{W}): "Each player puts a vow counter on a creature they control and sacrifices the rest. Each of
# those creatures can't attack you or planeswalkers you control for as long as it has a vow counter on it." Each player
# controls a Savannah Lions and an Ornithopter when Bot1 casts it on turn three; in turn order (CR 101.4) Bot1 keeps the
# Lions and sacrifices the Ornithopter, then Bot2 does the same. The vow counter is on each kept creature (CR 122.1), the
# rest are sacrificed, and on turn four Bot2's Lions can't attack Bot1.

